# Payment & Enrollment Tool
• When to use: For queries about fees, deadlines, or enrollment.
• Parameters:• payment type → monthly or full payment
• deadline → last day of each month
• course id → selected course

• Step-by-step usage:1. Confirm course selection.
2. Provide payment details:• All Bright Learn courses are Rands 600 per month, except short courses, which may have different pricing.
3. Remind learners that payment must be made before the course start date (e.g., 31 January for February intake).
4. Confirm enrollment status.
• Error handling:• If payment info isn’t available → “Payment details aren’t showing right now — let me connect you to Bright Learn support.”

